      "reviewRating": {
        "@type": "Rating",
        "ratingValue": "5"
      },
      "reviewBody": "Sometimes, simple and basic is just what you need.  This recipe hit the spot today.  True confession: I didn't use good olive oil.  I used the leftover oil from a jar of sun-dried tomatoes.  I think it worked well.",
      "author": {
        "@type": "Person",
        "name": "Doug Higgins"
