      "datePublished": "2026-09-27"
    },
    {
      "@type": "Review",
      "reviewRating": {
        "@type": "Rating",
        "ratingValue": "5"
      },
      "reviewBody": "Nagi, I followed the recipe almost to a tee. The only small alteration were I used a little less salt &amp; replaced with fish sauce (which I do with every rice or pasta/noodle dish anyway) &amp; gluten free pasta (Cucina Matese). In one sitting, it has moved into #1 position for a quick simple meal or accompiament. Had ours with some nice rib fillet.",
